<BaseLayout title="A Difficult Habit to Break — Racquet Habit" description="The Racquet Habit manifesto: a society of repeat players, established 2026.">
  <section class="editorial-hero" style="background: var(--ink)">
    <span class="eyebrow">Society note 001 / Manifesto</span>
    <h1>A difficult habit to <em>break.</em></h1>
    <p>There is always time for another set. This is how the condition usually presents.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="editorial-body">
    <aside class="editorial-aside">
      <span>Issue: RH-N001</span>
      <span>Read time: 02 min</span>
      <span>Condition: persistent</span>
    </aside>
    <article class="editorial-copy">
      <p>The court is a rectangle. The habit is not nearly so contained.</p>
      <h2>We know the pattern.</h2>
      <p>It starts with one booking. Then another racquet, a preferred grip, a particular warm-up, a weather app checked with unreasonable frequency. Weekends become draw sheets. Friends become opponents. The final set develops sequels.</p>
      <p>Racquet Habit exists for that space between sport and daily life—for people who do not need encouragement to play, only better things to carry with them.</p>
      <h2>Our uniform is deliberately composed.</h2>
      <p>No loud performance slogans. No borrowed club crest. No claim that every point is a metaphor for greatness. We prefer useful materials, exact typography and ornament built from the machinery of tennis itself.</p>
      <p>Look closely and the composure slips. The mark never completes its orbit. The label records an active condition. The towel is less discreet than the person carrying it.</p>
      <div class="principles">
        <div><h3>Play frequently.</h3><p>Daily court attendance is recommended, though not medically reviewed.</p></div>
        <div><h3>Choose precisely.</h3><p>Fewer pieces, better considered, used until they acquire their own record.</p></div>
        <div><h3>Leave the line open.</h3><p>The unresolved loop is a promise that the ritual continues tomorrow.</p></div>
      </div>
      <a class="button button--acid" href="/shop">Acquire the uniform <span>↗</span></a>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
